=== Test 1: RAW dependency ===
sgd depends on grad: true
sgd has deps: true
Correct order (grad then sgd): OK

=== Test 2: Disjoint routines ===
x does not depend on y: true
y does not depend on x: true
can_run x: true
can_run y: true
Reverse order (y then x): OK

=== Test 3: can_run ===
can_run grad (before execution): true
cannot run sgd (before grad): true
can_run sgd (after grad): true

=== Test 4: Wrong order raises ===
Wrong order raises Failure from Context.run: true

=== Test 5: Re-execution (grad -> sgd -> grad) ===
grad -> sgd -> grad: OK

=== Test 6: rollback of an execution marking ===
can_run sgd (after grad): true
cannot run sgd (after rollback): true
re-running grad restores it: true

=== Test 7: poisoned lineage ===
run refused, names the routine: true, names the cause: true
sync refused, names the routine: true, names the cause: true
get_values refused, names the routine: true, names the cause: true
copy out refused, names the routine: true, names the cause: true
copy in refused, names the routine: true, names the cause: true

=== Test 8: merge-buffer read dependency ===
merge transfer refuses an unexecuted source writer: true
merge transfer scopes runtime writers to the source buffer: true
merge consumer has exactly the transfer dependency: true
merge consumer can run after the transfer: true
merge overwrite refuses a pending consumer: true
first merge consumer reads the executed writer's values: true
overwriting invalidates the old merge consumer: true
rolled-back writer does not block the prior source value: true
replacement merge consumer reads the explicit upload: true

=== Test 9: merge reader under upload continuations ===
linear chain, nothing released: the refill refuses, naming the pending consumer: true
linear chain, latest upload value released: the refill goes ahead: true
forked leaves, linear leaf released: the refill refuses, naming the pending consumer: true
forked leaves, both released: the refill goes ahead: true
forked leaves, fork released: the refill refuses, naming the pending consumer: true
forked leaves, fork then linear leaf released: the refill goes ahead: true
a reader compiled after the refills reads the source values: true
